eight%22%3A22%2C%22text%22%3A%228%22%7D%2C%7B%22x%22%3A1342%2C%22y%22%3A382%2C%22width%22%3A30%2C%22height%22%3A21%2C%22text%22%3A%2264%22%7D%2C%7B%22x%22%3A400%2C%22y%22%3A384%2C%22width%22%3A92%2C%22height%22%3A22%2C%22text%22%3A%22LONG%20LONG%22%7D%2C%7B%22x%22%3A1054%2C%22y%22%3A442%2C%22width%22%3A17%2C%22height%22%3A22%2C%22text%22%3A%224%22%7D%2C%7B%22x%22%3A1342%2C%22y%22%3A443%2C%22width%22%3A30%2C%22height%22%3A21%2C%22text%22%3A%2232%22%7D%2C%7B%22x%22%3A423%2C%22y%22%3A443%2C%22width%22%3A46%2C%22height%22%3A19%2C%22text%22%3A%22FLOAT%22%7D%2C%7B%22x%22%3A1052%2C%22y%22%3A501%2C%22width%22%3A17%2C%22height%22%3A22%2C%22text%22%3A%228%22%7D%2C%7B%22x%22%3A1341%2C%22y%22%3A502%2C%22width%22%3A30%2C%22height%22%3A21%2C%22text%22%3A%2264%22%7D%2C%7B%22x%22%3A413%2C%22y%22%3A503%2C%22width%22%3A66%2C%22height%22%3A20%2C%22text%22%3A%22DOUBLE%22%7D%5D%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23f9f9f9%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22u3e16691a%22%7D"></card></p><h2 data-lake-id="jxc9o" id="jxc9o"><span data-lake-id="u07e32616" id="u07e32616">3.1 整型</span></h2><p data-lake-id="c1fd2d6547a7e9a1a7f69453816645c7" id="c1fd2d6547a7e9a1a7f69453816645c7"><span data-lake-id="u3c2106b4" id="u3c2106b4" class="lake-fontsize-12">在C语言中，整型数据一般用short、int、long三种数据类型来声明</span></p><card type="inline" name="codeblock" value="data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22int%20a%20%3D%20123%3B%20%2F%2F%20%E5%AE%9A%E4%B9%89%E4%BA%86%E4%B8%80%E4%B8%AA%E4%B8%93%E9%97%A8%E7%94%A8%E6%9D%A5%E5%AD%98%E5%82%A8%E6%95%B4%E6%95%B0%E7%9A%84%E5%8F%98%E9%87%8Fa%20%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A16%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Dimny%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card><p data-lake-id="5acd99a319cd3bf1021d81894a29b682" id="5acd99a319cd3bf1021d81894a29b682"><span data-lake-id="u05770189" id="u05770189" class="lake-fontsize-12">int 的本意是 integer，即整数的意思</span></p><p data-lake-id="d7c6eae1372ab1743b8409184862a371" id="d7c6eae1372ab1743b8409184862a371"><span data-lake-id="uf457879b" id="uf457879b" class="lake-fontsize-12">int a 代表在</span><span data-lake-id="u4c61fc69" id="u4c61fc69" class="lake-fontsize-12">内存中</span><span data-lake-id="u783a562a" id="u783a562a" class="lake-fontsize-12">开辟一块小区域，称为 a，用来存放整数，a 一般被称为变量。</span></p><p data-lake-id="u92065b4f" id="u92065b4f"><span data-lake-id="ucb60c656" id="ucb60c656" class="lake-fontsize-12">变量 a 所占内存大小，在不同的系统中是不一样的，64位系统典型的大小是4个字节</span></p><p data-lake-id="4408eca7b7c75811b5c5fba7a7cb5970" id="4408eca7b7c75811b5c5fba7a7cb5970"><span data-lake-id="ucdb5179e" id="ucdb5179e" class="lake-fontsize-12">​</span><br></p><p data-lake-id="42608de8ca0d407dd1cf609e1b568ceb" id="42608de8ca0d407dd1cf609e1b568ceb"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2024%2Fpng%2F46168485%2F1735560089219-42d047f2-fd82-4750-a75a-2e74c7338e81.png%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A1215%2C%22originHeight%22%3A353%2C%22ratio%22%3A1%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23f7f6f6%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22MGaJc%22%7D" class="lake-fontsize-12"></card></p><p data-lake-id="ef6e65f40e635d82c141aa26b137a039" id="ef6e65f40e635d82c141aa26b137a039"><span data-lake-id="u692045bb" id="u692045bb" class="lake-fontsize-12">整型修饰符</span></p><ul list="uc2021ce2"><li fid="u8658f7d4" data-lake-id="u72af3754" id="u72af3754"><span data-lake-id="uac71420e" id="uac71420e" class="lake-fontsize-12">short：用来缩短整型变量的尺寸，减少取值范围并节省内存，称为短整型</span></li><li fid="u8658f7d4" data-lake-id="u0c3e8268" id="u0c3e8268"><span data-lake-id="u5b243f21" id="u5b243f21" class="lake-fontsize-12">long：用来增长整型变量的尺寸，增大取值范围并占用更多内存，称为长整型</span></li><li fid="u8658f7d4" data-lake-id="u4e135d18" id="u4e135d18"><span data-lake-id="u17230643" id="u17230643" class="lake-fontsize-12">long long：用来增长整型变量的尺寸，增大取值范围并占用更多内存，称为长长整型</span></li><li fid="u8658f7d4" data-lake-id="u22782eae" id="u22782eae"><span data-lake-id="uc1d7f372" id="uc1d7f372" class="lake-fontsize-12">unsigned：用来去除整型变量的符号位，使得整型变量只能表达非负整数</span></li><li fid="u8658f7d4" data-lake-id="ued4676ce" id="ued4676ce"><span data-lake-id="ub430d4d8" id="ub430d4d8" class="lake-fontsize-12">使用整型修饰符后，关键字 int 可以被省略</span></li></ul><card type="inline" name="codeblock" value="data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22short%20int%20a%3B%20%2F%2F%20%E7%9F%AD%E6%95%B4%E5%9E%8B%20%25hd%20%20%20%20%20%20half%5Cnlong%20int%20b%3B%20%2F%2F%20%E9%95%BF%E6%95%B4%E5%9E%8B%20%25ld%5Cnlong%20long%20int%20c%3B%20%2F%2F%20%E9%95%BF%E9%95%BF%E6%95%B4%E5%9E%8B%20%25lld%5Cn%5Cnunsigned%20int%20e%3B%20%2F%2F%20%E6%97%A0%E7%AC%A6%E5%8F%B7%E6%95%B4%E5%9E%8B%20%25u%5Cn%5Cnunsigned%20short%20int%20f%3B%20%2F%2F%20%E6%97%A0%E7%AC%A6%E5%8F%B7%E7%9F%AD%E6%95%B4%E5%9E%8B%20%25hu%5Cnunsigned%20long%20int%20g%3B%20%20%2F%2F%20%E6%97%A0%E7%AC%A6%E5%8F%B7%E9%95%BF%E6%95%B4%E5%9E%8B%20%25lu%5Cnunsigned%20long%20long%20int%20h%3B%20%2F%2F%20%E6%97%A0%E7%AC%A6%E5%8F%B7%E9%95%BF%E9%95%BF%E6%95%B4%E5%9E%8B%20%25llu%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A16%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22IIurA%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card><p data-lake-id="u77fa3ea5" id="u77fa3ea5"><span data-lake-id="u39fe8f2f" id="u39fe8f2f" class="lake-fontsize-12">demo：</span></p><card type="inline" name="codeblock" value="data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%23include%20%3Cstdio.h%3E%5Cn%5Cnint%20main(int%20argc%2C%20char%20const%20*argv%5B%5D)%5Cn%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%5Cn%20%20%20%20short%20int%20a%3B%5Cn%5Cn%20%20%20%20a%20%3D%2010%3B%20%2F%2F%20%E5%B0%8610%E5%AD%98%E6%94%BE%E5%88%B0%E7%A9%BA%E9%97%B4a%E9%87%8C%E9%9D%A2%5Cn%5Cn%20%20%20%20short%20b%20%3D%20100%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20printf(%5C%22%25hd%5C%5Cn%5C%22%2Cb)%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%5Cn%20%20%20%20unsigned%20short%20ub%20%3D%20200%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20printf(%5C%22%25hu%5C%5Cn%5C%22%2Cub)%3B%5Cn%5Cn%20%20%20%20char%20c%20%3D%20-15%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20printf(%5C%22c%20%3D%20%25hhd%5C%5Cn%5C%22%2Cuc)%3B%5Cn%5Cn%20%20%20%20unsigned%20char%20uc%20%3D%2015%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20printf(%5C%22%25hhu%5C%5Cn%5C%22%2Cuc)%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%5Cn%20%20%20%20int%20d%20%3D%20-1024%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20printf(%5C%22%25d%5C%5Cn%5C%22%2Cd)%3B%2F%2F%20%25d%E5%8D%B3%E8%83%BD%E8%A1%A8%E7%A4%BA%E8%B4%9F%E6%95%B0%E4%B9%9F%E8%83%BD%E8%A1%A8%E7%A4%BA%E6%AD%A3%E6%95%B0%5Cn%5Cn%20%20%20%20unsigned%20int%20ud%20%3D%201024%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20printf(%5C%22%25u%5C%5Cn%5C%22%2Cud)%3B%20%2F%2F%20%25u%E4%B8%BA%E6%97%A0%E7%AC%A6%E5%8F%B7%E8%BE%93%E5%87%BA%5Cn%5Cn%5Cn%5Cn%5Cn%20%20%20%20return%200%3B%5Cn%7D%5Cn%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A16%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22GgRnf%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card><p data-lake-id="cad7a31529a59dfec79bfb7045954466" id="cad7a31529a59dfec79bfb7045954466"><span data-lake-id="u7126da2e" id="u7126da2e" class="lake-fontsize-12">有符号数</span></p><ul list="u9f1decd7"><li fid="u0fe4fef4" data-lake-id="u58e3948f" id="u58e3948f"><span data-lake-id="uea0b1f8d" id="uea0b1f8d" class="lake-fontsize-12">每一种基本数据类型都有两种形式：有符号数（signed）和无符号数（unsigned）</span></li><li fid="u0fe4fef4" data-lake-id="u774df288" id="u774df288"><span data-lake-id="u6332abfb" id="u6332abfb" class="lake-fontsize-12">比如一个1字节数据，如果是无符号数，最小是0000 0000，为0，最大为1111 1111，即2^8-1，为255</span></li><li fid="u0fe4fef4" data-lake-id="uc3cb6e9f" id="uc3cb6e9f"><span data-lake-id="ue4b04d24" id="ue4b04d24" class="lake-fontsize-12">如果是有符号数，最高位为符号位（无符号的整型数据，没有符号位），0表示正，1表示负</span></li><li fid="u0fe4fef4" data-lake-id="u029867f3" id="u029867f3"><span data-lake-id="ue0c8d831" id="ue0c8d831" class="lake-fontsize-12">如果不写signed或者unsigned，则代表默认有符号signed</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="574df8bf66e8fc34e8e9638cce876359" id="574df8bf66e8fc34e8e9638cce876359"><span data-lake-id="u642a45da" id="u642a45da" class="lake-fontsize-12">赋值</span></p><ul list="ua1f026e8"><li fid="ud5b7500b" data-lake-id="u54365ee5" id="u54365ee5"><span data-lake-id="ucc4034de" id="ucc4034de" class="lake-fontsize-12">八进制以0开头赋值   int a=010;</span></li><li fid="ud5b7500b" data-lake-id="u3f971b01" id="u3f971b01"><span data-lake-id="u6bc7c2ac" id="u6bc7c2ac" class="lake-fontsize-12">十六进制以0x开头     int a=0x10;</span></li><li fid="ud5b7500b" data-lake-id="u04935d95" id="u04935d95"><span data-lake-id="uee43309d" id="uee43309d" class="lake-fontsize-12">十进制正常赋值；</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="uf56e2c37" id="uf56e2c37"><card type="inline" name="label" value="data:%7B%22label%22%3A%22%E5%B8%B8%E8%A7%81%E5%8F%96%E5%80%BC%E8%8C%83%E5%9B%B4%22%2C%22colorIndex%22%3A0%2C%22id%22%3A%22GDQiI%22%7D" class="lake-fontsize-12"></card><span data-lake-id="u3c7da263" id="u3c7da263" class="lake-fontsize-12">：</span></p><card type="inline" name="codeblock" value="data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22unsigned%20char%200~255%5Cnchar%20-128...%20%2B%20127%5Cnint%20%20%E2%88%922147483648...%2B2147483647%5Cn%20%20%20%20%5Cnshort%20-32768~32767%5Cnunsigned%20short%200~65535(1111%201111%201111%201111)%202%5E16-1%5Cnunsigned%20int%200...%202%5E32-1%E5%8D%B3%204294967295%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A16%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22QstyA%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card><h3 data-lake-id="d17zF" id="d17zF"><span data-lake-id="uea1d17de" id="uea1d17de">3.1.1 码制</span></h3><p data-lake-id="73e8b5cd6315070676ff5e9866d10c0b" id="73e8b5cd6315070676ff5e9866d10c0b"><span data-lake-id="u270e6b1d" id="u270e6b1d" class="lake-fontsize-12">正数：原反补一致，均是原码本身，例如10</span></p><ul list="u3f579abc"><li fid="ued2e0f14" data-lake-id="u264d91bd" id="u264d91bd"><span data-lake-id="uce871062" id="uce871062" class="lake-fontsize-12">原码：0 000 1010</span></li><li fid="ued2e0f14" data-lake-id="u7300401a" id="u7300401a"><span data-lake-id="u970547d5" id="u970547d5" class="lake-fontsize-12">反码：0 000 1010</span></li><li fid="ued2e0f14" data-lake-id="ub734210b" id="ub734210b"><span data-lake-id="ub355a8b4" id="ub355a8b4" class="lake-fontsize-12">补码：0 000 1010</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="f2c6ee8d91cc0d59d60dd30c11b8f2ff" id="f2c6ee8d91cc0d59d60dd30c11b8f2ff"><span data-lake-id="u076b01b0" id="u076b01b0" class="lake-fontsize-12">负数：比如-10 </span></p><ul list="uaf6ad5fd"><li fid="ue1bb219f" data-lake-id="uba3330e4" id="uba3330e4"><span data-lake-id="u5893bd76" id="u5893bd76" class="lake-fontsize-12">原码：1 000 1010</span></li><li fid="ue1bb219f" data-lake-id="u5f11777f" id="u5f11777f"><span data-lake-id="u994c5e66" id="u994c5e66" class="lake-fontsize-12">反码：1 111 0101  （原码除符号位（负数为 1，正数为 0）不变，其余位取反）</span></li><li fid="ue1bb219f" data-lake-id="u6237e122" id="u6237e122"><span data-lake-id="u9f74accd" id="u9f74accd" class="lake-fontsize-12">补码：1 111 0110   （补码 = 反码 + 1），这也是计算机中对于数值-10最终的存放形式即：</span><u><span data-lake-id="u8bd7f500" id="u8bd7f500" class="lake-fontsize-12">负数在内存中存放形式是以补码方式存放的</span></u></li></ul><p data-lake-id="37d32c3a9e449aa6218555324576770b" id="37d32c3a9e449aa6218555324576770b"><span data-lake-id="uf89988f6" id="uf89988f6" class="lake-fontsize-12">公式：</span></p><p data-lake-id="f775a1ea1b377b8e61c6890a2e583459" id="f775a1ea1b377b8e61c6890a2e583459"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2024%2Fpng%2F46168485%2F1735560089413-9d9ccb86-68e6-4562-b2ff-7e70a70fcd5b.png%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A458%2C%22height%22%3A94%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A561%2C%22originHeight%22%3A115%2C%22ratio%22%3A1%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23faf8f7%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22VW1aM%22%7D" class="lake-fontsize-12"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u4bf83fcb" id="u4bf83fcb"><card type="inline" name="label" value="data:%7B%22label%22%3A%22%E6%80%BB%E7%BB%93%22%2C%22colorIndex%22%3A2%2C%22id%22%3A%22KZhI3%22%7D" class="lake-fontsize-12"></card><span data-lake-id="uc979c702" id="uc979c702" class="lake-fontsize-12">:负数的二进制表示方法：其绝对值的原码---》符号位变 1----》取反码（注意符号位不变）----》取补码（仅加一）</span></p><p data-lake-id="33df2aa361fb0baaef3e59deafec32c8" id="33df2aa361fb0baaef3e59deafec32c8"><br></p><p data-lake-id="3701fb7e9186f3bdcdb958f5ef1c66ce" id="3701fb7e9186f3bdcdb958f5ef1c66ce"><span data-lake-id="u7dd1cdd4" id="u7dd1cdd4" class="lake-fontsize-12">​</span><br></p><p data-lake-id="a8705bd8afd9cf0894acd1a13f63c0ae" id="a8705bd8afd9cf0894acd1a13f63c0ae"><span data-lake-id="ubb51e066" id="ubb51e066" class="lake-fontsize-12">数值溢出：</span></p><ul list="u33c72c66"><li fid="u836f9ae4" data-lake-id="u9087cb5e" id="u9087cb5e"><span data-lake-id="u0000037d" id="u0000037d" class="lake-fontsize-12">超过数据所能表达的范围，称为溢出，就像钟表，最大值和最小值是相邻的</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="5b92aace593a8535de4fe2481eeea873" id="5b92aace593a8535de4fe2481eeea873" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2024%2Fpng%2F46168485%2F1735560089851-3c92c006-a995-4d40-9a84-5cec173ceb56.png%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A257%2C%22height%22%3A253%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A568%2C%22originHeight%22%3A559%2C%22ratio%22%3A1%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23b2b6c8%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22J0ueL%22%7D" class="lake-fontsize-12"></card></p><card type="inline" name="codeblock" value="data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%25d%E7%94%A8%E4%BA%8E%E8%BE%93%E5%87%BA%E6%9C%89%E7%AC%A6%E5%8F%B7%E6%95%B0%EF%BC%9B%25u%E8%BE%93%E5%87%BA%E6%97%A0%E7%AC%A6%E5%8F%B7%E6%95%B0%5Cn%E5%BD%93cpu%E5%B0%86%E6%95%B0%E6%8D%AE%E8%BF%9B%E8%A1%8C%E8%BF%90%E7%AE%97%E7%9A%84%E6%97%B6%E5%80%99%EF%BC%8C%E7%9B%B4%E6%8E%A5%E4%BB%A5%E5%86%85%E5%AD%98%E4%B8%AD%E5%AD%98%E6%94%BE%E7%9A%84%E6%96%B9%E5%BC%8F%E6%9D%A5%E8%BF%90%E8%A1%8C%EF%BC%8C%E4%B9%9F%E5%B0%B1%E6%98%AF%E4%BB%A5%E8%A1%A5%E7%A0%81%E7%9A%84%E6%96%B9%E5%BC%8F%E5%8F%82%E4%B8%8E%E8%BF%90%E7%AE%97%5Cn%25u%E8%BE%93%E5%87%BA%E7%9A%84%E6%97%B6%E5%80%99%EF%BC%8C%E5%80%BC%E5%8C%BA%E5%9F%9F%E8%8C%83%E5%9B%B4%EF%BC%9A0-4294967295%EF%BC%88%E6%9C%89%E7%AC%A6%E5%8F%B7%E8%BD%AC%E4%B8%BA%E6%97%A0%E7%AC%A6%E5%8F%B7%E7%9A%84%E6%97%B6%E5%80%99%EF%BC%89%5Cn%25hhu%E6%96%B9%E5%BC%8F%E6%89%93%E5%8D%B0%EF%BC%8C%E5%80%BC%E5%9F%9F%E8%8C%83%E5%9B%B4%EF%BC%9A0-255%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A16%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Lflil%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card><card type="inline" name="codeblock" value="data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%23include%20%3Cstdio.h%3E%5Cn%5Cnint%20main()%5Cn%7B%5Cnchar%20ch%3B%5Cn%5Cnch%20%3D%200x7f%20%2B%202%3B%20%5Cnprintf(%5C%22%25d%5C%5Cn%5C%22%2C%20ch)%3B%5Cn%5Cnunsigned%20char%20ch2%3B%5Cnch2%20%3D%200xff%20%2B%201%3B%20%5Cnprintf(%5C%22%25u%5C%5Cn%5C%22%2C%20ch2)%3B%5Cn%5Cnch2%20%3D%200xff%20%2B%202%3B%20%5Cnprintf(%5C%22%25u%5C%5Cn%5C%22%2C%20ch2)%3B%5Cn%5Cnreturn%200%3B%5Cn%7D%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A16%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22PLdqq%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card><p data-lake-id="1fce9adebde05843b98318037d2efd1d" id="1fce9adebde05843b98318037d2efd1d"><span data-lake-id="u000dd541" id="u000dd541" class="lake-fontsize-12">表达范围：</span></p><p data-lake-id="59bee35f911c94a2c10fba51c4299c7b" id="59bee35f911c94a2c10fba51c4299c7b"><span data-lake-id="uf442f2bd" id="uf442f2bd" class="lake-fontsize-12">在64位机中，int型变量占4字节，就是32位，</span></p><ul list="ua2b24679"><li fid="u6dd69d77" data-lake-id="ucac3aafe" id="ucac3aafe"><span data-lake-id="uc175a30d" id="uc175a30d" class="lake-fontsize-12">当表示正数时，最高位为符号位（符号位为0），最大的正数是 0111 1111 1111 1111 1111 1111 1111 1111  即2147483647</span></li><li fid="u6dd69d77" data-lake-id="uef919eba" id="uef919eba"><span data-lake-id="uc8ef081e" id="uc8ef081e" class="lake-fontsize-12">当表示负数时，最高位为符号位（符号位为1），最小的负数是 1000 0000 0000 0000 0000 0000 0000 0000 而在计算机中是以补码的形式存储的，即-2147483648</span></li></ul><h2 data-lake-id="SeA9Y" id="SeA9Y"><span data-lake-id="ubdb8a5c3" id="ubdb8a5c3">3.2 浮点型</span></h2><p data-lake-id="bd454154c1e494a0ed7bfebef3647db9" id="bd454154c1e494a0ed7bfebef3647db9"><span data-lake-id="u3d819d58" id="u3d819d58" class="lake-fontsize-12">用来表达实数的数据类型</span></p><ul list="u197addae"><li fid="ude68743e" data-lake-id="uf729a8c1" id="uf729a8c1"><span data-lake-id="u4787ef4b" id="u4787ef4b" class="lake-fontsize-12">单精度浮点型（float），典型尺寸是4字节</span></li><li fid="ude68743e" data-lake-id="u6f49bc4f" id="u6f49bc4f"><span data-lake-id="uc4ac8ad6" id="uc4ac8ad6" class="lake-fontsize-12">双精度浮点型（double），典型尺寸是8字节</span></li><li fid="ude68743e" data-lake-id="u85e01bdc" id="u85e01bdc"><span data-lake-id="ueba5df7d" id="ueba5df7d" class="lake-fontsize-12">长双精度浮点型（long double），典型尺寸是16字节</span></li></ul><card type="inline" name="codeblock" value="data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22float%20f1%3B%20%2F%2F%20%E5%8D%95%E7%B2%BE%E5%BA%A6%5Cndouble%20f2%3B%20%2F%2F%20%E5%8F%8C%E7%B2%BE%E5%BA%A6%5Cnlong%20double%20f3%3B%20%2F%2F%20%E9%95%BF%E5%8F%8C%E7%B2%BE%E5%BA%A6%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A16%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22fPUb3%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card><p data-lake-id="u66944e92" id="u66944e92"><span data-lake-id="u4f6083a6" id="u4f6083a6" class="lake-fontsize-12">​</span><br></p><p data-lake-id="u241a4750" id="u241a4750" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2024%2Fpng%2F46168485%2F1735560090093-f0a57bad-9044-4e69-b00a-cd5690a4ef00.png%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A544%2C%22height%22%3A142%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A1099%2C%22originHeight%22%3A286%2C%22ratio%22%3A1%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23f8f2c5%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22bxBRV%22%7D" class="lake-fontsize-12"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u54c1a8b4" id="u54c1a8b4"><strong><span data-lake-id="u5c861eae" id="u5c861eae" class="lake-fontsize-12">浮点</span></strong></p><ul list="u0712b7ed"><li fid="uf9adad0b" data-lake-id="u27797ba1" id="u27797ba1"><span data-lake-id="u80ab365d" id="u80ab365d" class="lake-fontsize-12">C语言中，输出double类型以及float类型时，默认输出6位小数(不足六位以 0 补齐，超过六位按四舍五入截断)</span></li><li fid="uf9adad0b" data-lake-id="u15020a02" id="u15020a02"><span data-lake-id="u93ff383b" id="u93ff383b" class="lake-fontsize-12">单精度输出：%.2f ,中间数字是保留几位小数的意思，最好不要超过6，否则产生进位错误</span></li><li fid="uf9adad0b" data-lake-id="ueaa8cbaa" id="ueaa8cbaa"><span data-lake-id="u6aa68a1d" id="u6aa68a1d" class="lake-fontsize-12">双精度输出：%.8lf,中间数字是保留几位小数的意思，最好不要超过15，否则产生进位错误</span></li></ul><h2 data-lake-id="uXkeg" id="uXkeg"><span data-lake-id="uf45ca572" id="uf45ca572">3.3 字符型</span></h2><ul list="udde9483f"><li fid="u824aa684" data-lake-id="u29728ed9" id="u29728ed9"><span data-lake-id="u14290f8e" id="u14290f8e" class="lake-fontsize-12">字符类型可以表示单个字符,字符类型是 char，char 是 1 个字节(可以存字母或者数字)，多个字符称为字符串  </span></li><li fid="u824aa684" data-lake-id="ub17a910e" id="ub17a910e"><span data-lake-id="u410bf638" id="u410bf638" class="lake-fontsize-12">计算机中存储的都是1和0，因此各种字符都必须被映射为某个数字才能存储到计算机中，这种映射关系形成的表称为 ASCII 码表。</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="2a13219887a52ffcb1bdb2c4ae2d5a72" id="2a13219887a52ffcb1bdb2c4ae2d5a72"><span data-lake-id="ucc5c1434" id="ucc5c1434" class="lake-fontsize-12">​</span><br></p><table data-lake-id="JsfIT" id="JsfIT" margin="true" class="lake-table" style="width: 747px"><colgroup><col width="83"><col width="83"><col width="83"><col width="83"><col width="83"><col width="83"><col width="83"><col width="83"><col width="83"></colgroup><tbody><tr data-lake-id="u7ed4870e" id="u7ed4870e" style="height: 33px"><td data-lake-id="u91289a9d" id="u91289a9d" colSpan="2" style="background-color: #fae220"><p data-lake-id="d8907768fe653d1cef8ce6bcd73db966" id="d8907768fe653d1cef8ce6bcd73db966"><strong><span data-lake-id="u45405a73" id="u45405a73" class="lake-fontsize-12">数  值</span></strong></p></td><td data-lake-id="u2acb74a2" id="u2acb74a2" rowSpan="2" style="background-color: #feead9"><p data-lake-id="43b9961c496c9826a7f0b78ee35a1410" id="43b9961c496c9826a7f0b78ee35a1410"><strong><u><span data-lake-id="u37f9f7c5" id="u37f9f7c5" class="lake-fontsize-12">字符</span></u></strong></p></td><td data-lake-id="ua39ec254" id="ua39ec254" colSpan="2" style="background-color: #fae220"><p data-lake-id="87aa131f8392fa37cadfa36803a06b38" id="87aa131f8392fa37cadfa36803a06b38"><strong><span data-lake-id="ua978d7b6" id="ua978d7b6" class="lake-fontsize-12">数  值</span></strong></p></td><td data-lake-id="uda144e1e" id="uda144e1e" rowSpan="2" style="background-color: #feead9"><p data-lake-id="fb590491105298c4a82c39ef56a78ab0" id="fb590491105298c4a82c39ef56a78ab0"><strong><span data-lake-id="ucde7dc2f" id="ucde7dc2f" class="lake-fontsize-12">字符</span></strong></p></td><td data-lake-id="uf5461836" id="uf5461836" colSpan="2" style="background-color: #fae220"><p data-lake-id="12134b74de0dbc5bbfe90a1c0d272cc0" id="12134b74de0dbc5bbfe90a1c0d272cc0"><strong><span data-lake-id="uc2ad98f0" id="uc2ad98f0" class="lake-fontsize-12"